# GainChek v2 — Environment Setup
#
# GainChek uses separate environment files for the server and client workspaces:
#
# 1. Server configuration:
#    Copy `server/.env.example` to `server/.env` and configure:
#    - DATABASE_URL
#    - JWT_SECRET
#    - GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
#    - CLIENT_URL
#    - PORT
#    - RESEND_API_KEY & RESEND_FROM_EMAIL
#    - ENABLE_DEV_LOGIN
#
# 2. Client configuration:
#    Copy `client/.env.example` to `client/.env` and configure:
#    - VITE_API_URL
#    - VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
#
# NOTE: Never put DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET, or RESEND_API_KEY into client/.env!
# Vite embeds all VITE_* variables into the public browser build.
